[{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l012","ordinal":294657,"en":"Why had she remained apart from the people?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l013","ordinal":294658,"en":"Her waist was sheathed, her face moonlike—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l014","ordinal":294659,"en":"Ah, what a radiant, unfortunate lady!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l015","ordinal":294660,"en":"Supple as an ermine,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l016","ordinal":294661,"en":"Her face glittered like the sun;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l017","ordinal":294662,"en":"She sat in dignity, glowing."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l018","ordinal":294663,"en":"Sixty clasps and forty buttons"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l019","ordinal":294664,"en":"Flashed upon her breast."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l020","ordinal":294665,"en":"The Zhediger who saw her"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l021","ordinal":294666,"en":"Despaired of every woman they had seen."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l022","ordinal":294667,"en":"At the overwhelming wonder,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l023","ordinal":294668,"en":"Whoever looked upon her trembled."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l024","ordinal":294669,"en":"When Churok whispered,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l025","ordinal":294670,"en":"Her voice was like a brass komuz;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l026","ordinal":294671,"en":"The black hair down her back"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l027","ordinal":294672,"en":"Was like the plumage of a parrot."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l028","ordinal":294673,"en":"When she turned, her face flashed;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l029","ordinal":294674,"en":"Great earrings fashioned of gold"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l030","ordinal":294675,"en":"Glittered upon her breast."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l031","ordinal":294676,"en":"And then there was Churok—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l032","ordinal":294677,"en":"No, not Churok, but a force of upheaval,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l033","ordinal":294678,"en":"That infidel woman of singular nature,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l034","ordinal":294679,"en":"That graceful lady,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l035","ordinal":294680,"en":"The renowned Lady Churok."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l036","ordinal":294681,"en":"This woman was no mere Churok,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l037","ordinal":294682,"en":"But turmoil that could ruin a people;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l038","ordinal":294683,"en":"That champion, Akun's daughter,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1402:b004:l039","ordinal":294684,"en":"Truly was the moon itself."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l001","ordinal":294685,"en":"For noble men, Churok"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l002","ordinal":294686,"en":"Truly was a fitting companion."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l003","ordinal":294687,"en":"This woman truly possessed"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l004","ordinal":294688,"en":"A power to ruin peoples"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l005","ordinal":294689,"en":"And slaughter nations."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l006","ordinal":294690,"en":"Good heavens, if blood fell upon black earth,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l007","ordinal":294691,"en":"Behold her flesh, whiter than snow;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l008","ordinal":294692,"en":"If blood fell upon snow,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l009","ordinal":294693,"en":"Behold her face, redder than blood."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l010","ordinal":294694,"en":"Supple as an ermine,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l011","ordinal":294695,"en":"When Aichurok smiled,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l012","ordinal":294696,"en":"Her broad white teeth gleamed."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l013","ordinal":294697,"en":"Seeing Churok's form,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l014","ordinal":294698,"en":"All the khans raised a clamor."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l015","ordinal":294699,"en":"Many a man, meaning to carve meat,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l016","ordinal":294700,"en":"Cut his own hand along with it."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l017","ordinal":294701,"en":"The people bustled in amazement;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l018","ordinal":294702,"en":"The nation rejoiced and proclaimed"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l019","ordinal":294703,"en":"That the peerless, unfortunate lady"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l020","ordinal":294704,"en":"Had astonished the Zhediger people."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l021","ordinal":294705,"en":"They marveled at her beauty:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l022","ordinal":294706,"en":"The noble, luckless woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l023","ordinal":294707,"en":"Was indeed a renowned beauty."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l024","ordinal":294708,"en":"\"Our people were disrupted and strife arose;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l025","ordinal":294709,"en":"It was fitting that hero Kojo and hero Toltoy"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l026","ordinal":294710,"en":"Were slain,\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l027","ordinal":294711,"en":"They said of the events gone by."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l028","ordinal":294712,"en":"Because of that radiant, luckless woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l029","ordinal":294713,"en":"Because of renowned Churok,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l030","ordinal":294714,"en":"Gray-maned Toltoy the lion died;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l031","ordinal":294715,"en":"Chynkojo and Tolok died together,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l032","ordinal":294716,"en":"And many souls died in grief."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l033","ordinal":294717,"en":"Because of this overwhelming woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l034","ordinal":294718,"en":"Many khans who met her died;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l035","ordinal":294719,"en":"Because of this Churok,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l036","ordinal":294720,"en":"They took up spear and sword,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l037","ordinal":294721,"en":"Fired guns and drew bows,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l038","ordinal":294722,"en":"And fought in bloody clashes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b003:l039","ordinal":294723,"en":"Look—the people died;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l001","ordinal":294724,"en":"See how many giants died,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l002","ordinal":294725,"en":"One alone and many together;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l003","ordinal":294726,"en":"Heroes died in suffering."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l004","ordinal":294727,"en":"The people were slaughtered amid clamor;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l005","ordinal":294728,"en":"The heavenly people fell into turmoil."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l006","ordinal":294729,"en":"The nation split into hostile camps,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l007","ordinal":294730,"en":"Opposing and attacking one another,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l008","ordinal":294731,"en":"Ripping lungs and piercing gallbladders,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l009","ordinal":294732,"en":"Killing and cutting off heads;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l010","ordinal":294733,"en":"Many peoples suffered massacre."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l011","ordinal":294734,"en":"It was a God-struck affair;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l012","ordinal":294735,"en":"That the multitude suffered torment"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l013","ordinal":294736,"en":"Was true without a lie."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l014","ordinal":294737,"en":"It was a blessed and wondrous night."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l015","ordinal":294738,"en":"Ah, that radiant, daring woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l016","ordinal":294739,"en":"Was a heavenly noble lady,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l017","ordinal":294740,"en":"The very firebrand"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l018","ordinal":294741,"en":"Who had peoples raided and heroes slain."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l019","ordinal":294742,"en":"Her name was beautiful Churok,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l020","ordinal":294743,"en":"Yet she was turmoil, not mere Churok."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l021","ordinal":294744,"en":"She was an infidel woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l022","ordinal":294745,"en":"Who shook nations and disrupted peoples,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l023","ordinal":294746,"en":"The very night of divine power,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l024","ordinal":294747,"en":"The very firebrand herself."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l025","ordinal":294748,"en":"Whoever saw her burned like an ember;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l026","ordinal":294749,"en":"Seeing the fierce woman's beauty,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l027","ordinal":294750,"en":"What soul could look and remain unmoved?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l028","ordinal":294751,"en":"\"If only she were my wife,\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l029","ordinal":294752,"en":"Thought every soul who saw her and burned."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l030","ordinal":294753,"en":"Ah, that radiant, luckless woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l031","ordinal":294754,"en":"Was herself a noble peri,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l032","ordinal":294755,"en":"The dark eye at the heart of turmoil,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l033","ordinal":294756,"en":"One of the truest beauties."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l034","ordinal":294757,"en":"The noble, unfortunate woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l035","ordinal":294758,"en":"Had ranged over the breadth of the earth;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l036","ordinal":294759,"en":"When this shapeshifting woman transformed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l037","ordinal":294760,"en":"She flew and wandered"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l038","ordinal":294761,"en":"Through the four corners of the world,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1403:b005:l039","ordinal":294762,"en":"Fanning a tail like a parrot's."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l001","ordinal":294763,"en":"The accursed woman Aichurok"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l002","ordinal":294764,"en":"Had flown over and surveyed"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l003","ordinal":294765,"en":"Every inhabited land."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l004","ordinal":294766,"en":"Her eyes saw into the distance;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l005","ordinal":294767,"en":"She was a wise woman who had seen many lands."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l006","ordinal":294768,"en":"Among all women in flowing dresses,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l007","ordinal":294769,"en":"She alone had won the race."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l008","ordinal":294770,"en":"When the luckless one was a girl,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l009","ordinal":294771,"en":"Her father Akun wrapped and veiled her in gold"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l010","ordinal":294772,"en":"And had her raised in splendor."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l011","ordinal":294773,"en":"Knowing she was a noble peri,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l012","ordinal":294774,"en":"A great judge surpassing the people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l013","ordinal":294775,"en":"One with ears to hear and eyes to see,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l014","ordinal":294776,"en":"A discerning judge of sorrow approved her."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l015","ordinal":294777,"en":"After accepting Akun's hospitality"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l016","ordinal":294778,"en":"And eating the meal he offered,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l017","ordinal":294779,"en":"He departed saying, \"This daughter of yours"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l018","ordinal":294780,"en":"Will bring upheaval upon the earth.\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l019","ordinal":294781,"en":"With a tail trailing like a cuckoo's,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l020","ordinal":294782,"en":"The great sage father Kuroshon"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l021","ordinal":294783,"en":"Saw her and judged her."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l022","ordinal":294784,"en":"Looking upon her outward form,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l023","ordinal":294785,"en":"He found her perfect in every measure."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l024","ordinal":294786,"en":"My father Kuroshon uttered a marvel;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l025","ordinal":294787,"en":"He said this to Khan Akun:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l026","ordinal":294788,"en":"\"From the ridge of the Mediyan desert,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l027","ordinal":294789,"en":"From the shore of Bel-Soorun,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l028","ordinal":294790,"en":"While pursuing game and surveying the land,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l029","ordinal":294791,"en":"You found Churok in the open plain"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l030","ordinal":294792,"en":"When she was still an infant."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l031","ordinal":294793,"en":"As though finding the Night of Power,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l032","ordinal":294794,"en":"You rejoiced at that blessing,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l033","ordinal":294795,"en":"Your heart surging,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l034","ordinal":294796,"en":"And named her Churok."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l035","ordinal":294797,"en":"When I observe her,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l036","ordinal":294798,"en":"Many a soul will lose his senses,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l037","ordinal":294799,"en":"Thinking, 'If only she were mine.'"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l038","ordinal":294800,"en":"Infidel and Muslim alike"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b003:l039","ordinal":294801,"en":"Will lose their wits and contend;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l001","ordinal":294802,"en":"The peoples who see her will quarrel."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l002","ordinal":294803,"en":"Your Churok will prove truly beautiful,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l003","ordinal":294804,"en":"And strife will arise before her."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l004","ordinal":294805,"en":"She is a peri herself,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l005","ordinal":294806,"en":"The dark eye at the heart of conflict."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l006","ordinal":294807,"en":"She is one of those firebrands"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l007","ordinal":294808,"en":"Who divide peoples and slaughter nations."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l008","ordinal":294809,"en":"Her face is a burning ember;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l009","ordinal":294810,"en":"No servant of God is her equal."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l010","ordinal":294811,"en":"Heed these words:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l011","ordinal":294812,"en":"Give her to a lionhearted hero"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l012","ordinal":294813,"en":"Who will yield to no one in the world."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l013","ordinal":294814,"en":"She is a maiden famed as Churok;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l014","ordinal":294815,"en":"If your daughter lives,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l015","ordinal":294816,"en":"Her conflicts will shake the age."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l016","ordinal":294817,"en":"She is famed as a noble peri;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l017","ordinal":294818,"en":"If this child of yours lives,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l018","ordinal":294819,"en":"Her troubles will touch all humankind."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l019","ordinal":294820,"en":"Will those who desire to take her"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l020","ordinal":294821,"en":"Ever lie still without quarreling?\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l021","ordinal":294822,"en":"That discerning father who saw her"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l022","ordinal":294823,"en":"Sharpened his precious tongue"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l023","ordinal":294824,"en":"And before Khan Akun"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l024","ordinal":294825,"en":"Spoke for many days."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l025","ordinal":294826,"en":"He began every kind of discourse;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l026","ordinal":294827,"en":"Each of his words was excellent."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l027","ordinal":294828,"en":"If you attend to your discerning father,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l028","ordinal":294829,"en":"And consider every word,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l029","ordinal":294830,"en":"Each strikes like a spear."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l030","ordinal":294831,"en":"If your name is Khan Akun,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l031","ordinal":294832,"en":"If you are one who clearly knows"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l032","ordinal":294833,"en":"What comes and what departs,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l033","ordinal":294834,"en":"Joy and suffering,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l034","ordinal":294835,"en":"Violence and humiliation,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l035","ordinal":294836,"en":"Then heed these words"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l036","ordinal":294837,"en":"And find her rightful master."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l037","ordinal":294838,"en":"Her remote ancestor was Tugol Khan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l038","ordinal":294839,"en":"Khydyr's blessing entered her lineage;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1404:b004:l039","ordinal":294840,"en":"Her foremost ancestor was Babyr Khan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l001","ordinal":294841,"en":"From Chayan and Boyon,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l002","ordinal":294842,"en":"From Ilek and Tumon,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l003","ordinal":294843,"en":"From Nogoi Khan himself,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l004","ordinal":294844,"en":"From the line of hero Kara Khan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l005","ordinal":294845,"en":"From evil-minded Zhakyp,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l006","ordinal":294846,"en":"His true-born descendant,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l007","ordinal":294847,"en":"Born after going to Altai,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l008","ordinal":294848,"en":"Who brought commotion to the world,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l009","ordinal":294849,"en":"Whose eyes saw into the distance,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l010","ordinal":294850,"en":"Who alone won every contest,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l011","ordinal":294851,"en":"Whom no man defeated in combat,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l012","ordinal":294852,"en":"Whom no hostile foe approached,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l013","ordinal":294853,"en":"Zhakyp Khan's only son,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l014","ordinal":294854,"en":"The plane tree of the world's peoples,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l015","ordinal":294855,"en":"The refuge of the Kyrgyz—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l016","ordinal":294856,"en":"To Manas, Zhakyp's only son,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l017","ordinal":294857,"en":"In Keng-Kol and Talas,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l018","ordinal":294858,"en":"Give her as a bride, he said."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l019","ordinal":294859,"en":"\"Give her to Manas and you will prosper;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l020","ordinal":294860,"en":"Give her to the hero and you will flourish."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l021","ordinal":294861,"en":"Gold coins and ruby stones"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l022","ordinal":294862,"en":"You will place in your treasury,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l023","ordinal":294863,"en":"And from the strife upon the earth,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l024","ordinal":294864,"en":"Hero, you will preserve your head.\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l025","ordinal":294865,"en":"Dear Akun heeded"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l026","ordinal":294866,"en":"The discerning judge's words,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l027","ordinal":294867,"en":"And gave the fierce woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l028","ordinal":294868,"en":"As a bride to Khan Manas."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l029","ordinal":294869,"en":"She was the khan's wife;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l030","ordinal":294870,"en":"Now she was an ill-fated bondwoman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l031","ordinal":294871,"en":"Her head seized as spoil—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l032","ordinal":294872,"en":"The very accursed woman."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l033","ordinal":294873,"en":"For this graceful woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l034","ordinal":294874,"en":"This grievous infidel woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l035","ordinal":294875,"en":"This woman grown old,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l036","ordinal":294876,"en":"There could be no place among the people"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l037","ordinal":294877,"en":"Of these people-wearing infidels."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l038","ordinal":294878,"en":"Look at the way she moves!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b003:l039","ordinal":294879,"en":"She was the wife of a hero blessed by Khydyr;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l001","ordinal":294880,"en":"Her calamity will touch many."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l002","ordinal":294881,"en":"Her son is famed as Khan Semetey."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l003","ordinal":294882,"en":"Will this bloody clan bow"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l004","ordinal":294883,"en":"And submit to another?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l005","ordinal":294884,"en":"If she does not die, this woman's conflict"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l006","ordinal":294885,"en":"Will fall upon the Zhediger."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l007","ordinal":294886,"en":"Will princely, gray-maned Semetey"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l008","ordinal":294887,"en":"Allow another to tread his bed?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l009","ordinal":294888,"en":"Will he not strike from above?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l010","ordinal":294889,"en":"Will anyone who treads the pillow"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l011","ordinal":294890,"en":"Of the famed hero, the Magnanimous One, prosper?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l012","ordinal":294891,"en":"This evil deed, this disastrous affair—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l013","ordinal":294892,"en":"Will it not strike us to the soul?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l014","ordinal":294893,"en":"Hearing Kanchoro had spoken thus,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l015","ordinal":294894,"en":"Dear Kiyaz grew agitated."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l016","ordinal":294895,"en":"He had come to take a wife"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l017","ordinal":294896,"en":"And met with great turmoil."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l018","ordinal":294897,"en":"Kanchoro turned blood into blood"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l019","ordinal":294898,"en":"And laid the bloodthirsty hero low."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l020","ordinal":294899,"en":"Finding no place to flee,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l021","ordinal":294900,"en":"Finding no deep pit to enter,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l022","ordinal":294901,"en":"Will we die a wretched death?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l023","ordinal":294902,"en":"With the people ruined and the nation fleeing,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l024","ordinal":294903,"en":"Will we die a wretched death?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l025","ordinal":294904,"en":"The wise men said these things;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l026","ordinal":294905,"en":"Some souls whispered,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l027","ordinal":294906,"en":"Listening to one another"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l028","ordinal":294907,"en":"And probing what lay behind the words."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l029","ordinal":294908,"en":"They nudged one another in the ribs"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l030","ordinal":294909,"en":"And trembled together."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l031","ordinal":294910,"en":"Some wise men among the Zhediger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l032","ordinal":294911,"en":"Had begun to judge the matter."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1405:b004:l033","ordinal":294912,"en":"Thinking of what would follow, some"}]
